I won't touch the main checkout. Its jusprin-dev still has the two unpushed commits from other sessions (`1324166f77` and `39ef221200`), and it is still missing the three newer commits on GitHub, including the splash merge `534f7d69cc`. Until someone merges or rebases it, a build from the main checkout will still have the old splash with the sliding bar.

Everything else is done:
- the splash animation is on GitHub's jusprin-dev;
- the canvas's splash boards match it (version 172);
- `claude/splash-name-anim` is pushed and its worktree has no uncommitted changes.

